  "body": "Lot 2 & 3 have very nice homeowners; this is your chance to be part of this community. \r\n\r\nLot 1 is road frontage in a row of only 3 \r\n\r\nBrand new four double bedrooms enjoy excellent sun, with heat pumps on each level ensuring year-round comfort. The master suite is a private retreat with a walk-in wardrobe, balcony and tiled ensuite, while the main bathroom includes a fluted freestanding bath. Downstairs offers open-plan living with a big double internal access garage that includes an integrated laundry\r\n\r\nLow maintenance grounds allow more time to enjoy nearby cycleways, the Meadowbank Pourewa Shared Path, and the beaches of Mission Bay, Kohimarama and St Heliers, all featuring vibrant cafes and shops. Zoned for St Thomas School and Selwyn College, with Eastridge and Meadowbank shopping centres nearby and public transport close at hand, this home offers effortless living in a sought-after location.\r\n\r\nAvailable for immediate possession... If you like the photos you must view this home.",
